id: pm-slack-loss-aware-payloads
title: Compile bounded Slack payloads with exact loss receipts
description: "Compile Slack wire payloads with per-field clipping and omission receipts plus stable recovery links. Scope excludes generic redaction, output budgeting and renderer registries."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: loss-receipts,payload,slack
created_at: "2026-10-29T05:49:43.965Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-29T06:37:55.624Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Oversized block and text fixtures respect documented payload bounds; Every clipped source span is accounted for with a recovery link; Urgent status and identity fields are never silently removed; Malformed payloads refuse before sending
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-29T05:50:04.404Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: core output budgets govern JSON/TOON projection, existing attention coalescing governs event counts, and pm-slack-standup owns standup generation. Existing Slack renderers truncate fields without receipts. No equivalent compiler or duplicate open item/PR found. Design: a pure bounded compiler and strict shared wire schema; explicit protected paths and stable recovery URLs; SDK-backed read-only item projection; no new durable state, leases, import, sync, or remote writes. Existing delivery state machines remain separate. No transaction isolation claim: commitWorkspaceTransaction does not exclude ordinary writers (pm-cli#1620). Read-only compilation observes a snapshot and never applies a saved plan."
  "2026-10-29T06:00:56.256Z",codex-agent,"Implementation: shared strict static Block Kit schema validates compiler inputs and every outbound webhook payload; pure compiler records nonoverlapping original UTF-16 ranges, typed protected_overflow refusals and recovery links. SDK item projection protects identity, status, priority, assignee, parent and full dependency fields without lifecycle name comparisons. Canonical full SDK reads explicitly disable output budgets; command uses only the host-injected client. Compact paginated TOON/JSON output carries a source digest. Focused oversized/schema/zero-socket tests pass; seeded 500-sequence no-git readback and packed acceptance are underway."
  "2026-10-29T06:04:22.308Z",codex-agent,"Public read-only validation at main d01c295bb719b74df06d075b4df9d6719cfd3cda: 96 items compiled, 0 refusals, 1 exact text clipping receipt, 0 omissions, 95944 total payload bytes, maximum 3312 bytes and 4 blocks, 96 identical replays. All 199 copied tracker files and permissions unchanged; git absent from PATH; 0 mutations/posts. Reproduction and measured scope are recorded in docs/payload-compilation-validation.md."
  "2026-10-29T06:20:10.658Z",codex-agent,"Verification: linked node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/payload-compilation.test.ts passed 7 tests including 500 seeded SDK readback/replay sequences. Additional focused boundary tests cover full-read refusals, strict envelope byte caps and regular-file input. Behavioral revert proof passed: pass-through compiler fails, removing the pre-send guard fails, restoring both passes. Packed acceptance passed all five supported installation shapes on pm 2026.10.28; CI now repeats the captured-artifact acceptance on Node 26. Full npm/Bun release gates remain CI evidence, not a local full-suite claim. Local health has inherited global pm-github host-version skew plus the already-tracked legacy provenance advisory; neither was repaired or rewritten."
  "2026-10-29T06:29:24.302Z",codex-agent,"Final boundary review found that shared-reference SDK input could describe an oversized JSON expansion. Added cumulative encoded-string accounting during the same strict parse, before aggregate serialization; a dense fixture describes roughly 2.5 GB through shared references and refuses promptly. The final exact envelope/wire checks remain in place. Six focused compiler/transport/source tests pass after the hardening. Earlier CI already passed both npm gates and entered Bun gates; the follow-up push requires fresh exact-head evidence."
  "2026-10-29T06:37:54.743Z",codex-agent,"Implementation head 57f1e2a passed https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack/actions/runs/40829578310: npm and Bun release gates on Node 22 and 26, each 1012/1012 tests with 100 percent lines, branches and functions (4048 gate test executions total). Captured-artifact acceptance passed 5/5 install shapes; SHA-256 0852eaee3ba60eab940b63a6637a5c0d483a356447d41d67fab438868447ff87. CodeQL passed. The final-source public read-only probe again matched all recorded numbers: 96 items, 1 clipping receipt, max 3312 bytes/4 blocks, 199 unchanged files, 96 exact replays, zero mutations/posts. PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack/pull/171 (ready for review). Bot review availability is missing evidence: CodeRabbit skipped automatic review, Greptile expired, Cubic neutral. This receipt commit needs a fresh CI run before final handoff; no item closure, merge or release."
